 <h3><u>Hussain ke dar par</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Hussain Ke Dar Par... (9)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (3)<br> Jo Chahiyea... Jo Chahiye...<br> Jo Chahiye Woh Milenga Hussain Ke Dar Par&nbsp;<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
  <p>1)Sunayi &nbsp;Beto Ko Rahib Ne Dastane&nbsp; Yaqeen,<br> Mera Hussain Hai Sab Kuch Naseeb Kuch Bhi Nahi,<br> Agar Magar Nhi Hota...<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
  <p>2)Meri Nazar Me Ye Tafsir Fazkuruni Hai,<br> Ke Ek Bheed Si Taa Ashiqo Ki Rehti Hai,<br> Khuda Ke Dar Se Zyada...<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
  <p>3)Damishq Me Dare Zainab Pe Jo Shahid Hua,<br> Khud Aake Le Gaye Abbas Unko Karbobala,<br> Huyi Namaze Janaza...<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
  <p>4)Shaheed Kehte Hai Ye Auj Humne Paya Hai,<br> Hume Hussain Ne Khud Karbala Bulaya Hai,<br> Hai Ab Qayam Hamara...<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
  <p>5)Salaat Me Mere Hum Raah Hogi Ruhe Salaat,<br> Mai Baade Matame Sarwar Imame Asr Ke Sath,<br> Namaze Asr Padhunga...<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
  <p>6)Wahab Ki Maa Se Takabul Karona Rahib Ka,&nbsp;<br> Dare Hussain Pe Wo Bete Lene Aaya Tha,<br> Ye Dene Ayi Hai Beta...<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
  <p>7)Karam Ka Chota Sa Ek Mojiza Sunau Tumhe,<br> The Do karod Bashar Karbala Me Phir Bhi Hume,<br> Nahi Mila... Nahi Mila... Nahi Mila Koi Bukha&nbsp;<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
  <p>8)Ye Aur Baat Ke Sulbo Me Kar Raha Tha Safar,<br> Kaha Tha Maine Bhi Labbayk Istegase Par,<br> (Labbaik Ya Hussain)<br> Bhala Mai Kaise Na Jata...<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
  <p>9)Bata Gayi Hai 'Takallum' Nazar Buzurgo Ki,<br> Bani Asad Me Tabarij Ke Qafele Me Kahi,<br> Mile Imame Zamana...<br> Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)<br> Likha Hua Hai Ye Maula Hussain Ke Dar Par... (2)</p> 
